{"about_the_game":"<strong>Politics The Game DEMO</strong>  <br><br>It's high time to claw your way to the top!  <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609770/extras/GIF1_EN.gif?t=1744375206\" />  <br><br><strong>Politics The Game DEMO</strong> gives you a taste of the first RPG that lets you become a parliamentarian, create your own party, and try to survive in the ruthless world of politics!  <br><br>In the DEMO version, you can test core gameplay mechanics, explore unique character abilities, and see if you have what it takes to rise to power!  <br><br><strong>What's waiting for you in the DEMO?</strong>  <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li> Choose from several available parliamentarians  <br></li><li> Experience the first story-driven missions inspired by Polish politics  <br></li><li> Use powerful special abilities:  </li></ul>  <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609770/extras/ENG_GIF2.gif?t=1744375206\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">  <li> Critical attack using a battle cat? Try it out!  <br></li><li> German agent curse that drains your opponent\u2019s popularity? Absolutely!  <br></li><li> Evacuating weakened units from the festival with a police Black Hawk? You bet!  </li></ul>  <br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609770/extras/ENG_GIF1.gif?t=1744375206\" />  <br><br><strong>Politics The Game DEMO</strong> offers a fun and accessible gameplay experience with a unique sense of humor, but mastering the highest difficulty level requires serious strategic thinking. Test your skills and get ready for the full version!  <br><br>Add <strong>Politics The Game</strong> to your wishlist so you don't miss the full release!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609770?t=1744375206","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic